@startuml
' Activity 4: teacher test and child answers. Transcribed from Diagram/ACTIVITY/act-4-quiz.drawio.
skinparam wrapWidth 150
|Teacher|
|System (BE)|
|Child|

|Teacher|
start
:Choose the kind of test;
if () then ([post-test])
  :Switch on post-tests for the class;
  |System (BE)|
  :Create a post-test when a child finishes a chapter;
else ([class test])
  |Teacher|
  :Pick 1<U+2013>100 questions from the bank;
  :Create the test as DRAFT, due date optional;
  :Publish the test;
endif
|System (BE)|
:Show the PUBLISHED test to the children it is for;
|Child|
:Answer the questions;
:Submit the answers;
|System (BE)|
if () then ([due date passed or\nalready submitted])
  :Refuse the submission;
  stop
else ([else])
  :Grade on the server; answers never go to the child;
  |Child|
  :See right or wrong for each question;
endif
|Teacher|
:View the class results;
stop
@enduml
